  "bio": "Dmitriy Mikhailov, based out of Saint Petersburg, Russia, is a highly skilled tattoo artist, specializing in geometric and tribal style black tattoos. Exemplifying utmost professionalism and competence, his devotion to cleanliness and preciseness is reflected in every detailed piece of art he crafts on the skin. From NYC to Russia, he continues to astound with his remarkable talent capturing the beauty of simplicity and symmetry.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Saint Petersburg, Northwestern Federal District, Russia\n\nGeometric/ornamental tattoos, East coast.",
